  "summary": "Ghost from 6.10.3 before 6.64.0 RCE via Theme Translation Files",
  "details": "Ghost from 6.10.3 before 6.64.0 contains a remote code execution vulnerability that allows authenticated administrators to run code by abusing theme translation file loading. Attackers with administrator access can upload a crafted theme containing malicious translation files to execute arbitrary code on the Ghost server.",
